      "oemPartNumber": null,
      "description": "The upper half of the two-piece sump: an aluminium casting bolting to the block's bottom face, carrying the oil pickup and the level-sensor boss, and forming the upper half of the sealed sump joint. THIS is the area the operator's garage identified as leaking (2026-08). Note: the two-piece construction is typical of this engine family but is NOT described in the project dossier — verify the exact parts against ETKA before ordering.",
